department with complaint of a swollen tongue after
he had seafood 2 hours ago. His medical history is
remarkable for diabetes mellitus for which he is
taking metformin 500md 8-hourly, hypertension
controlled on ramipril and indapamide, and
hypercholesterolemia treated with atorvastatin 20mg
daily. He mentions no itching. On examination, he
has stable vital signs with no respiratory or abdominal
symptoms. Which one of the following could be the
most likely cause of this presentation?','{"A":"Anaphylaxis.","B":"C1 esterase inhibitor deficiency.","C":"Ramipril.","D":"Atorvastatin.","E":"Metformin."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-8cb97fe5668b","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"d2ae08bb8fc33197b699","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","source_page":135,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"50352f072b7edf191d41","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Pharmacology 1-33.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Pharmacology 1-33.pdf","source_page":139,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"6d68cf350863a047dea1","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","source_page":134,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"c5af1162531613c9bad0","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1426,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"d2ae08bb8fc33197b699","source_file":"Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex Pharma Onco Immuno 2025.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":135,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Oncology/Immunology","stem":"A 52-year-old man presents to the emergency\ndepartment with complaint of a swollen tongue after\nhe had seafood 2 hours ago. His medical history is\nremarkable for diabetes mellitus for which he is\