management of this patient?','{"A":"A. Repeat troponin in 8 hours.","B":"OB. Immediate reperfusion therapy.","C":"C. Repeat the ECG in 6 hours.","D":"D. Start him on beta blockers.","E":"E. Serial ECGs."}','B','With ST elevation in leads Il, Ill, and aVF on the given ECG, this patient has sustained an inferior ST-
